grund.toml is read as version 2.

misplaced-declaration
A declaration sits outside the home its kind is configured to live in.

Severity: error, fixed.
On: when folders or files is set on a [schema.kinds] table (a setting)
Fix, move: move it to a home of its own kind
Fix, unlisted: add "{entry}" to [workspace] members in {enclosing}, or exclude "{entry}/" with [schema.sources] exclude in {enclosing}
Fix, roots: also remove configured scan roots at or beneath "{entry}" in {enclosing} (source includes or kind homes), because exclude does not prune scan roots

Next: grund config explain '[schema.kinds]'
